data_wse2
# Phase identity: PyRITE crystal catalog entry [wse2].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# 2H-WSe2 (P6_3/mmc): isostructural with MoSe2 -- W on Wyckoff 2c (1/3,2/3,1/4),
# Se on 4f with z = 0.621 (delta = |0.75 - 0.621| = 0.129 from its W plane).
# Experimental single-crystal refinement: Schutte, De Boer & Jellinek,
# J. Solid State Chem. 70, 207--209 (1987),
# doi:10.1016/0022-4596(87)90057-0; COD 9012193. It gives a=3.282,
# c=12.960 A and Se 4f z=0.62110. The W-Se bond
# sqrt((a/sqrt(3))^2 + (0.1291 c)^2) = 2.53 A matches the refined value.
